<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH DIVISION ONE PLAY-OFF SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH DIVISION ONE PLAY-OFF SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English division one</p>
